WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.476
Hi! Tomorrow is our family picnic. Let's get the food!

2
00:00:06.926 --> 00:00:10.688
First, milk for the kids. A bottle of milk…

3
00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:13.831
…and a glass of milk for me, now!

4
00:00:16.081 --> 00:00:21.468
Then the bakery. We are six people, so two loaves of bread.

5
00:00:21.918 --> 00:00:23.915
One loaf, two loaves!

6
00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:30.949
Three slices of bread make a big sandwich. Yum!

7
00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:35.110
It's hot, so we need a lot of water.

8
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:40.018
Two bottles of water? No, six bottles of water!

9
00:00:42.268 --> 00:00:44.915
And for dessert? Ice cream!

10
00:00:45.365 --> 00:00:48.384
Two scoops of ice cream for me, please!

11
00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:54.117
Now, a cup of coffee and I'm ready!

12
00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:58.793
And you? How many cups of coffee do you drink in a day?

